    "description": "### Impact\r\nThis affects anyone who uses S3 for uploads. While scripts may be executed, they will only be run in the context of the S3/CDN domain, with no site credentials.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nDisallow html or xml files for uploads in authorized_extensions. For existing html xml uploads, site owners can consider deleting them.\r\n",
